@startuml
title UML sequence - native payment: persisted intent, interruption recovery and action-bound step-up
actor Customer
participant "App" as App
participant "Secure storage" as Store
participant "System browser" as Browser
participant "Issuer" as Issuer
participant "bank-api" as API
Customer -> App : Review payment
App -> API : POST /payment-quotes
App -> Store : save {idempotencyKey, quoteId}
App -> API : POST /payments (Idempotency-Key)
note right of App : process death / timeout here
App -> Store : on restart: pending found
App -> API : POST /payments (same key) -> same payment id
App -> API : GET /payments/{id} (truthful status)
Customer -> App : Approve and send
App -> API : POST /payments/{id}/approval -> challengeId
App -> API : POST /approvals/{challengeId}/native-step-up -> nonce
App -> Browser : authorize(prompt=login, max_age=0, nonce, PKCE)
Browser -> Issuer : password
Issuer -> App : piggybank://auth/callback?code
App -> Issuer : token exchange (code_verifier) -> id_token
App -> Issuer : revoke step-up refresh token
App -> API : POST /approvals/{challengeId}/native-proof {idToken}
API -> API : verify signature, aud bank-mobile, nonce, sub, auth_time >= begin;\nrecord single-use step-up proof
App -> API : POST /payments/{id}/confirmation -> ACCEPTED ... SETTLED
@enduml
